---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

/*
 * Ported from the previous terms.html. Substance unchanged except "Our
 * Services", which described a pre-launch site offering game day coverage and
 * team packages. Both statements are now false and the first one directly
 * contradicts the A2P 10DLC resubmission, so it has been updated to describe
 * the service actually offered.
 *
 * The "Text Messaging (SMS)" section is A2P-reviewed wording — do not reword it
 * without reading reference/a2p-10dlc-playbook.md first.
 */
---

<Legal
	title={`Terms of Service | ${site.name}`}
	heading="Terms of Service"
	updated="September 2026"
>
	<p>
		These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of this website, operated by Brandon
		Garner Photography ("we," "us," or "our"). By using this site or contacting us, you agree
		to these Terms.
	</p>

	<h2>Our Services</h2>
	<p>
		Brandon Garner Photography provides custom sports portrait photography for individual
		athletes, including one-on-one portrait sessions, art-directed composite portraits, and
		archival prints. Sessions are booked by inquiry and quoted individually; pricing and
		availability are confirmed in writing before any session is scheduled.
	</p>

	<h2>Contacting Us</h2>
	<p>
		If you reach out through the chat feature on this site, you agree that we may use the
		information you provide to respond to your inquiry and, if you ask us to, to let you know
		when our booking and services go live. You may ask us to stop contacting you at any time.
	</p>

	<h2>Text Messaging (SMS)</h2>
	<p>
		If you choose to communicate with us via text message or provide your phone number and opt
		in to SMS communications, you agree to receive messages related to your inquiry,
		scheduling, and updates about our services. Message and data rates may apply. Message
		frequency varies. Reply STOP at any time to opt out, or HELP for assistance. Consent to
		receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing any services.
	</p>

	<h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
	<p>
		You agree not to misuse this website, including attempting to access it using automated
		means, interfering with its normal operation, or submitting false or misleading information
		through our forms.
	</p>

	<h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
	<p>
		All photographs, text, graphics, and other content on this site are the property of Brandon
		Garner Photography unless otherwise noted, and may not be used or reproduced without
		permission.
	</p>

	<h2>No Warranty</h2>
	<p>
		This website and its content are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express
		or implied.
	</p>

	<h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
	<p>
		To the fullest extent permitted by law, Brandon Garner Photography shall not be liable for
		any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
	<p>
		We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of this site after changes are
		posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact Us</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about these Terms can be directed to <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a>{' '}
		or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. Our mailing address is {site.address}.
	</p>
</Legal>
